' Aus test_guards.py uebertragen (18 Faelle, aufgezeichnet 2026-09-07). Format: docs/werkzeuge.md, dhrt test.

=== guard basic (1)
DIM x AS INTEGER
x = 5
DIM flag AS BOOLEAN
flag = TRUE

SELECT CASE x
    CASE 1 TO 10 WHERE flag
        PRINT "klein und flag"
    CASE 1 TO 10
        PRINT "klein ohne flag"
    CASE ELSE
        PRINT "gross"
END SELECT
--- erwartet
klein und flag

=== guard basic (2)
