=== guard with in operator (1)
' Praktisch: Guard mit IN-Test.
DIM tag AS STRING
tag = "admin"
DIM cmd AS STRING
cmd = "delete"

SELECT CASE cmd
    CASE "delete" WHERE tag IN ("admin", "moderator")
        PRINT "OK"
    CASE "delete"
        PRINT "Permission denied"
END SELECT
--- erwartet
OK

=== guard with in operator (2)
